---
import { release } from "../data/release";
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="intro">
    <a class="release" href="https://github.com/the-focus-company/ppmlx.dev/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Development v{release} <span>Read the changelog</span></a>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Local models.<br />A familiar API.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Run language models on Apple Silicon with MLX. Connect your editor, coding agent, or application through one local server.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#quickstart" class="btn-primary">Get started</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx" class="btn-secondary">View source</a>
    </div>
    <p class="requirements">macOS on Apple Silicon <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Python 3.11–3.12 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> MIT license</p>
  </div>
  <aside id="quickstart" class="quickstart" aria-labelledby="quickstart-title">
    <div class="code-header"><h2 id="quickstart-title">Quick start</h2><span>Terminal</span></div>
    <div class="code-body">
      <p class="code-note">Install ppmlx</p>
      <div class="command"><code>uv tool install ppmlx</code><button type="button" data-copy="uv tool install ppmlx" aria-label="Copy install command">Copy</button></div>
      <p class="code-note">Download a model</p>
      <div class="command"><code>ppmlx pull llama3</code></div>
      <p class="code-note">Start the local server</p>
      <div class="command"><code>ppmlx serve --model llama3</code></div>
      <p class="endpoint">http://localhost:6767/v1</p>
      <p class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <p class="code-footer">With pip: <code>pip install ppmlx</code><br /><a href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx#install">Installation options</a></p>
  </aside>
</section>
<style>
.hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; padding-top: 72px; padding-bottom: 70px; }
.release { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.release span { border-left: 1px solid var(--border); padding-left: 10px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 400; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 4.5vw, 58px); letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.08; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.lede { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 440px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
.hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
.requirements { margin: 22px 0 0; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.9; }
.requirements span { margin: 0 5px; color: #b0bac7; }
.quickstart { min-width: 0; border: 1px solid #ccd5e1; border-radius: 7px; background: var(--bg-surface); }
.code-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.code-header h2 { font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0; margin: 0; }
.code-header span { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
.code-body { padding: 23px 22px 0; }
.code-note { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.command { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; min-height: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.command code { font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.command button { flex-shrink: 0; padding: 4px 8px; color: var(--text-secondary); background: white; border: 1px solid #ccd5e1; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; }
.endpoint { margin: 4px 0 0; font: 12px/1.6 var(--font-mono); color: #216e58; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.copy-status { min-height: 18px; margin: 4px 0; font-size: 11px; }
.code-footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 13px 22px; margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.9; }
@media (max-width: 850px) { .hero { gap: 32px; } }
@media (max-width: 720px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; gap: 32px; } .lede { max-width: 560px; } }
</style>
